                    circulated within the U.S. Delegation as CEV MEMO–8b. The minute was agreed by
                        Dulles and Eden at their meeting on June 27 (see <ref
                        target="#d478">Document 478</ref>).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d486-f2" n="2" xml:id="d486-f2-content">
